<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With extensive experience across film, television fiction, advertising, and documentary, I have contributed to over seven feature films as an Assistant Director and Chief Assistant Director. Additionally, I have produced TV fiction for television and worked with numerous brands in roles such as Line Producer, Project Manager, and Chief Assistant Director. My diverse background showcases my ability to manage and execute complex projects with creativity and precision.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
