567 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With a diverse background in the commercial and alternative film industries, I have completed seven feature films as an Assistant Director, Executive Producer, and Line Producer. My journey began in 2012 as an Assistant Director on the film "Jibon Dhuli," directed by the legendary Tanvir Mokammel. Since then, I have had the privilege of working with another iconic filmmaker, Morshedul Islam, as well as numerous other nationally acclaimed directors in Bangladesh. I have contributed to projects that have won national awards and received funding from the Government of Bangladesh, along with several that have achieved both national and international acclaim.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
