575 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I have extensive experience in documentary filmmaking, collaborating closely with renowned documentary filmmaker Tanvir Mokammel on projects like "Border Line," which explores the Partition of India. Additionally, I worked with the Bangladesh Air Force on "Kilo Flight," a documentary centered on the Bangladesh Liberation War in 1971. These projects have been pivotal in my career, contributing to my work being recognized both nationally and internationally in the documentary genre.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
