/ActualText (In the vibrant world of advertising agencies and production houses like Gorai Films and Golpolok, I've thrived as a versatile professional. From crafting persuasive copy to managing projects and directing as a chief assistant in advertising agencies, each role has deepened my passion for creative storytelling and strategic execution in media and entertainment.)
