612 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I have had the privilege of working with numerous GOs, NGOs, and advocacy groups on impactful films. Documenting the real-world struggles of underprivileged communities and their resilience has been incredibly inspiring. These experiences have fueled my passion for storytelling and highlighted the power of film to drive social change. Whether writing, assisting, or directing, each project has deepened my understanding of humanity and reinforced my commitment to making a difference through film.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
>>
