621 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I have had the honor of working with remarkable organizations such as BRAC, Fulki, and World Vision. However, the project with the World Bank stands out as the most exhilarating experience. Documenting the mobility of handicapped individuals not only opened my eyes to their incredible strength and resilience but also profoundly changed my perspective on life and its challenges. This project inspired me to appreciate the indomitable spirit of those who face adversity and reinforced my commitment to using film as a medium for social change and awareness.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
