/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ("Alo Adharer Kabbo" tells the story of two contrasting couples. The older, blind couple finds deep happiness in their unconditional love, relying on trust and emotional connection. In contrast, the young, sighted couple struggles with constant complaints and misunderstandings, judging each other based on appearances.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
644 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Witnessing the blind couple's profound bond, the young couple learns that true love transcends physical sight. They realize that love should be felt, cherished, and nurtured beyond superficial judgments, leading to a deeper and more genuine connection.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
