/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ("A City of Lie" unfolds in the vibrant and enigmatic city of Kolkata. A young Bangladeshi photographer, exploring the city and capturing its essence, takes a picture of a beautiful lady and instantly falls in love. Obsessed, he starts chasing her but fails to find her.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
655 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A suspicious character offers to help him, but eventually, the photographer realizes he has been deceived. Throughout his journey, the photographer discovers the stunning locales of Kolkata and begins to uncover a deeper truth about himself. He realizes he is no ordinary person but someone with a rebirth, suggesting he may have lived a previous life long ago and has now been reborn in the present day.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
