/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ("Blog" portrays a critical period in Bangladesh from 2013 to 2017, marked by targeted killings of bloggers who challenged fundamentalism and societal norms through social media and blogs. The film follows a blogger facing daily threats and challenges for his outspoken views. Despite the dangers, he continues to advocate for freedom of expression until he tragically becomes a victim of anonymous violence, highlighting the sacrifices made in the pursuit of speaking truth to power.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [0]
