/ActualText (My upcoming project examines the profound changes in rural Bangladesh following a major global event in 2001. This period it marked significant societal and technological shifts that deeply influenced local communities. The narrative delves into the transformation of communication, economic adjustments, and the social dynamics that emerged as a result. Through this exploration, the film captures the complexities and challenges rural populations face during a time of rapid change.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [0]
