/ActualText (I excel at screenplay writing and take great pride in crafting the scripts for most of my projects myself. To me, the script is the backbone of a film, and I cannot rely on others for such a crucial element. I am passionate about writing and dedicate myself to perfecting my scripts. Through my writing, I aim to convey meaningful messages and bring my vision to life on screen.)
/Pg 24 0 R
