695 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (My approach to filmmaking embraces the guerrilla style, a technique characterized by its raw and authentic portrayal of stories. By shooting quickly and often with minimal equipment in real-world settings, I aim to capture the essence of my narratives with a sense of immediacy and realism. This hands-on approach allows me to navigate challenges creatively, emphasizing spontaneity and the genuine reactions of actors and surroundings. Guerrilla filmmaking not only shapes the visual aesthetic of my productions but also reflects my commitment to capturing stories with authenticity and a unique perspective.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [0]
>>
