<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (I am dedicated to telling diverse stories that reflect the rich tapestry of human experience. My films feature characters from various ideological, economic, and religious backgrounds, speaking different languages and making unique choices. I focus on local communities, especially the underprivileged who lack a political voice, to highlight their struggles and resilience. Through my work, I celebrate humanity's diversity and emphasize our shared essence, promoting inclusivity and giving a platform to those who have been marginalized.)
/E (I am dedicated to telling diverse stories that reflect the rich tapestry of human experience. My films feature characters from various ideological, economic, and religious backgrounds, speaking different languages and making unique choices. I focus on local communities, especially the underprivileged who lack a political voice, to highlight their struggles and resilience. Through my work, I celebrate humanity's diversity and emphasize our shared essence, promoting inclusivity and giving a platform to those who have been marginalized.)
