716 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (My filmmaking philosophy revolves around ethical practices that prioritize the well-being of every individual, including animals and the environment. I uphold rigorous standards to minimize environmental impact, ensure labor safety, and depict communities with respect and authenticity. My films are committed to truthfulness and integrity, aiming to foster empathy and promote positive social impact. Additionally, I strive to create a safe and inclusive set environment for all cast and crew members. By integrating these principles, I hope to inspire other filmmakers to adopt similar ethical approaches.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [0]
>>
