/ActualText (I have had the privilege of attending the Kolkata International Film Festival repeatedly in 2015, 2016, and 2017 as a student delegate. These experiences allowed me to participate in workshops and discussions, watch diverse films, and build networks with fellow filmmakers and industry professionals. The Kolkata International Film Festival was my first exposure to how expansive and impactful a film festival can be, serving as a significant learning platform in my journey as a filmmaker.)
