763 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I have been actively involved with the Dhaka International Film Festival from 2016 to 2024, attending as a delegate, volunteer, and member. My engagement with the festival has been multifaceted, including serving as a sub-editor for their bulletin during the 16th edition in 2018. This festival, the largest in Bangladesh, screens over 300 films annually and attracts numerous international delegates. My experiences here have been invaluable, providing opportunities to learn, network, and contribute to the vibrant film community in Bangladesh.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
