770 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In 2018, I worked with the Global Youth Film Festival, Bangladesh, as a festival programmer, where I was deeply involved with the core organizing team. It was the 2nd edition of this festival, a small but significant initiative outside of Dhaka. Today, the Global Youth Film Festival has grown into one of the largest and most renowned film festivals in Bangladesh, showcasing the power and potential of youth in the film industry.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [2]
>>
