780 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I attended the 4th Nepal Cultural International Film Festival in Kathmandu in 2022 as a delegate. The festival, set against the stunning backdrop of the Himalayas, featured a diverse array of films and celebrated Nepal's rich cultural heritage. It brought together international delegates, fostering a vibrant exchange of ideas and artistic perspectives. Engaging with filmmakers from around the world provided valuable insights and expanded my understanding of global cinema.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [0]
>>
