800 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I am honored to be selected as the curator for Bangladesh at the 5th International Kolkata Short Film Festival, India, for 2025. In this role, my responsibility is to curate exceptional Bangladeshi films that reflect the richness of our cinema and present them to the festival. I am excited to showcase the creativity, talent, and stories from our filmmakers on this international platform, fostering cross-cultural dialogue and strengthening the cinematic bond between Bangladesh and India.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [1]
>>
