807 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With my experience from various international film festivals, I have decided to organize an international film festival in Kushtia, in collaboration with Kushtia Shilpakala Academy. Known as the cultural capital of Bangladesh, Kushtia boasts a rich heritage with iconic figures such as Lalon Shah, Rabindranath Tagore, Mir Mosharraf Hossain, and Kangal Harinath enriching the locality. Given its cultural diversity, it is the perfect place to launch a film festival to enhance the appreciation of cinema among the local audience.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [0]
>>
