/ActualText (Established in 2020, Jheel Kutum Cafe was the first film-themed cafe in the country, serving as a vibrant hub for filmmakers and film enthusiasts. Tragically, it suffered a fire accident on June 14, 2023, but its legacy of supporting local independent filmmakers and fostering a strong creative network endures.)
