/ActualText (I am always active in advocating for the betterment of the Bangladeshi film industry, passionately speaking out about filmmakers' rights, copyright issues, and government corruption in the sector. Here are some news clippings highlighting my efforts and the ongoing dialogue surrounding these important topics.)
