938 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I pursued a BA in Journalism at CMR University in Bangalore, India, but I dropped out in 2015 to focus more on my passion for filmmaking. That same year, I enrolled in the BSc program in Media Science, majoring in Film Making, at Maulana Abul Kalam Azad University in Kolkata, India, and graduated in 2018. These experiences gave me a strong foundation in both journalism and filmmaking, allowing me to blend creative storytelling with effective communication skills.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [1]
>>
