<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I have completed various workshops on filmmaking, film appreciation, and film understanding, including a notable workshop on Iranian film conducted by John W. Hood. Additionally, I took a film appreciation course from the British Film Institute \(BFI\), conducted by the legendary filmmaker Tanvir Mokammel. These experiences have deepened my knowledge and passion for exploring diverse narratives in cinema.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [2]
