952 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (My hobbies include reading books, listening to live concerts, running marathons, hiking hill tracks, and engaging in meditation activities. These pursuits help me stay balanced, both mentally and physically. Whether it's immersing myself in a good book, enjoying the energy of live music, or finding peace through meditation, I enjoy activities that promote personal growth and well-being. Participating in marathons and hiking in hill tracks also keeps me active and connected with nature, complementing my holistic approach to life.)
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [0]
>>
