/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I consider Rabindranath Tagore, Satyajit Ray, Akira Kurosawa, Abbas Kiarostami, and Gautam Buddha as my inspirations. I strive to be a peacekeeping individual, deeply influenced by the philosophy of peace and the importance of spreading love. Their works and teachings inspire me to pursue a life focused on harmony and compassion.)
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [1]
